title: Registration
template: page-event-default
ref: apachecon-us-2000

## Registration Information

**As of Monday night, Web-based registration is no longer available. You may now only register on-site in Orlando.**

Onsite registration and badge pickup hours:

- Wednesday, 8 March 2000: 7:30am – 7:30pm
- Thursday, 9 March 2000: 7:00am – 9:00pm
- Friday, 10 March 2000: 8:30am – 5:30pm

## What You Get

Conference registration gives you access to all sessions, keynotes, and tutorials on the days for which you are registered. In addition, you have free access to the exhibit area on those days.

Night school classes are 90-minute sessions on Wednesday and Thursday night, providing a more in-depth coverage of specific topics.

## Registration Fee Schedule

### Full Conference Packages (all three days)

| Package | Price (USD) |
|---------|-------------|
| Early-Bird (no longer available) | $975 |
| Full conference registration | $1,200 |
| Group rate (3 or more) | $950 each |
| Student rate | $500 |
| Academic rate | $750 |
| Night School | $150/class |

### Partial Conference Registration

| Package | Price (USD) |
|---------|-------------|
| Daily registration | $450/day |
| Night School | $250/class |

### Other Packages

| Package | Price (USD) |
|---------|-------------|
| Exhibit pass only (pre-registered) | Free |
| Exhibit pass only (onsite) | $25 |

## Notes

- All conference registrations include access to the exhibits for the days registered.
- Night school registration is not included in any other package.
- Packages cannot be combined; *e.g.*, two people and a student registering together will pay two full-price fees and a student fee, not two group-rate fees plus the student fee.
- All amounts are in U.S. dollars.
- All fees are per-person; there are no shared-attendance registrations. Name substitutions may be made.
- A cancellation fee of US $75 applies to all cancellations received after 7 February 2000. Cancellations received after 28 February 2000 are not eligible for refunds.
